1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:05,150
Every day, Leo walked home the same way.

2
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:10,250
Clink?

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,040
A jacket, as white as nothing at all.

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,790
And Leo was gone.

5
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,640
Invisible, he could go anywhere.

6
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,900
Next door, there was a pool that nobody ever swam in,

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,110
and a lady who sat beside it, all alone.

8
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,980
Leo didn’t want to hide any more.

9
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,850
“Fancy a swim?” she asked.

10
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:54,160
And the pool was never empty again.
